{
  "sourceLanguage": "es",
  "strings": {
    "": {},
    "%@ necesita una versión más nueva de macOS.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ needs a newer version of macOS."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ tiene activada la entrada segura. El texto quedó en el portapapeles: pegalo con ⌘V.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ has secure input enabled. The text is on the clipboard — paste it with ⌘V."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ · %@"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$@ · %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · %@ · %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ · %@ · %@"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$@ · %2$@ · %3$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "25 idiomas europeos, incluido español": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "25 European languages, Spanish included"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "30 idiomas que gestiona macOS": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "30 languages managed by macOS"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Abrir Ajustes": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Abrir Ajustes del Sistema": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open System Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Abrir Susurro al iniciar sesión": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Susurro at login"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accesibilidad": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Accessibility"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accesibilidad habilitada": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Accessibility enabled"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accesibilidad hace falta para dos cosas: escuchar la tecla aunque estés en otra app, y pegar el texto donde tenés el cursor. Sin ese permiso Susurro transcribe igual, pero deja el texto en el portapapeles.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Accessibility is needed for two things: hearing the key while you're in another app, and pasting the text where your cursor is. Without it Susurro still transcribes, but leaves the text on the clipboard."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Acerca de": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Además arma párrafos o listas cuando el dictado lo pide.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Also breaks text into paragraphs or lists when the dictation calls for it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ajustes de Susurro": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
